{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Rejoice, the [G/B]Lord [C]is [Am]King! [G]YourLord [Em]and [G7/D]King [C]adore!
[G]Rejoice, [C]give [Am]thanks, [Em/B]and [Dm]sing [D7/C]and [G/B]triumph [C]evermore
[C]Lift [F]up [G7/D]your [Am]heart, [C/E]lift [G/D]up [C]your [F/A]voice!
[C/G]Rejoice, [Em]again [Dm/F]Isay, [G]re [C]joice!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Jesus, the [G/B]Savior, [Am]reigns, [G]The [F]God [Em]of [G7/D]truth [C]and [G]love;
[G]When [C]He had [Am]purged [Em/B]our [Dm]stains, [D7/C]He [G/B]took [C]His [G/D]seat [Dm]above
[C]Lift [F]up [G7/D]your [Am]heart, [C/E]lift [G/D]up [C]your [F/A]voice!
[C/G]Rejoice, [Em]again [Dm/F]I [C/G]say, [G]rejoice!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]His kingdom cannot fail, [Am]He [G]rules [F]o'er [Em]earth [G7/D]and [C]heaven
[G]The keys [C]of death [Am]and [Em/B]grave [Dm]Are [D7/C]to [G/B]our [C]Jesus [Dm]given
[C]Lift [F]up [G7/D]your [Am]heart, [C/E]lift [G/D]up [C]your [F/A]voice!
[C/G]Rejoice, [Em]again [Dm/F]I [C/G]say, [G]rejoice!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]Rejoice in [G/B]glorious [Am]hope! [G]Our [F]Lord [Em]the [G7/D]judge [C]shall [G]come,
[G]And [C]take His [Am]servants [Dm]up [D7/C]To [G/B]their [C]eternal [G]home
[C]Lift [F]up [G7/D]your [Am]heart, [C/E]lift [G/D]up [C]your [F/A]voice!
[C/G]Rejoice, [Em]again [Dm/F]I [C/G]say, [G]rejoice!
